<<<
Everyone says sea’ fight, sea’ god, sea’ gull. sea’ horse, sea’ mark, sea’ nymph, sea’ piece, sea’ room, sea’ serpent;
===
Everyone says *sea' fight, sea' god, sea' gull.* *sea' horse, sea' mark, sea' nymph, sea' piece, sea' room, sea' serpent;*
